====== T-Home Speedport W 503V Typ C (ARV8528PW22) ======
The T-Home Speedport W 503V Typ C (ARV8528PW22) is an IAD sold by Deutsche Telekom with an ADSL2+ Annex B/J Modem, 802.11abgn Wifi and two FXS ports as well as a S0 bus connector. The device is manufactured by Arcadyan.

|{{:meta:icons:tango:48px-dialog-warning.svg.png?nolink}}| This device is **very different** from the Speedport W503 **Typ A**! |

|{{:meta:icons:tango:48px-emblem-progress.svg.png?nolink}}| This device is **not supported** yet.|

