===== Enable UART =====
Currently it is unclear how to enable UART mode on this device.

While stupidly poking around at the board, i found the following:
  * Connecting R65 with the side facing the CPU to 3,3V enables CFG 05 mode 


Also there are some hints at the page of [[toh:t-com:speedport_w_504v#enable_uart_mode|speedport w504v]], but to me it does look as if R80 is the correct choice here.

Sadly i seemed to completely brick the device by connecting C557 to ground. 
